  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRC Towards Community Self-Reliance through the Nexus Approach TCSN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to improve the food security and enhance social cohesion and self-reliance of communities affected by crises in Gao and Mopti regions in an environment that protects their rights. Climate-smart and climate-resilient food production are amongst the project activities. The project target group consists of vulnerable IDPs (60%) and hosts communities (40%) facing food insecurity within the crisis affected region of Gao and Mopti.  The project will promote women&apos;s active participation to enable them to have more influence on decisions and self-reliance.</narrative>
  </description>
